# BuildKit ignore file for server/Dockerfile (context = repository root).
# Build context is an explicit allowlist: local kubeconfig/mail credentials,
# native installers and internal notes must never reach a container builder.
**
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/
!crates/**
!server/
!server/**
**/target
**/.env
**/.dev-mail
**/node_modules
**/AGENTS.md
**/*.log
